# QA Criteria Directory

This directory contains QA acceptance criteria files for each task.
Files are auto-generated during Phase 3c: Success Criteria Generation.

## Structure
- {TASK-ID}.yaml - Acceptance criteria for each task
- {TASK-ID}-review-{N}.json - QA review results (generated during Phase 4)

## Usage
- QA sub-agent reads ONLY files from this directory
- Never add tech spec or implementation details here
- See `.claude/skills/aid-impl-plan/references/iron-rules.md` for content rules
